## Build Instructions

Build in the linux.student.cs environment from the repository root:

    make clean
    make

A successful build produces:

    iotest.elf
    iotest.img

The Raspberry Pi image to upload is:

    iotest.img

## Upload and Run Instructions

Upload to Track C:

    /u/cs452/public/tools/upload.sh ./iotest.img trackc

Upload to Track D:

    /u/cs452/public/tools/upload.sh ./iotest.img trackd

After uploading, reset the corresponding Raspberry Pi and observe the serial output in gtkterm.

